  "description": "BODGOS crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C87 H123 Gd7 N6 O33,11(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.635-5.093 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.02-176.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd7(OH)6(CO3)3(sach)3(sachH)3(MeOH)6]·11MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
